Main Functionality – Code Routings

The Main Functionality of PocketSmart AI is implemented using different code routes to handle user requests and generate personalized recommendations.

1. Home Recommendation Route
/generate-home

This route receives the user's home requirements such as budget, room type, furniture, decoration, and lighting. Based on the selected category and budget, the system generates suitable product recommendations.

2. Party Recommendation Route
/generate-party

This route handles party and event requirements such as event type, budget, number of guests, catering, venue, and decoration. The system categorizes the requirements and generates suitable recommendations.

3. Recommendation Route
/recommendations

This route processes the user's requirements and filters recommendations according to category, budget, and preferences.

4. Product Integration Route
/products

This route connects the recommendation system with external shopping platforms such as Amazon, Flipkart, and IKEA to provide relevant product information and links.

5. AI Processing Route
/ai

This route connects with the Gemini API to understand user requirements, categorize the situation, and generate personalized recommendations.

